*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*&      Form  BUILD_HEADER_QUALITY
*&  WERKS di kolom 14, INSPTYPE di kolom 96 (sesuai CLM_0014/CLM_0096)
*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
FORM BUILD_HEADER_QUALITY CHANGING PV_HEADER TYPE STRING.
  DATA: LV_TAB TYPE STRING,
        LV_I   TYPE I.

  LV_TAB = CL_ABAP_CHAR_UTILITIES=>HORIZONTAL_TAB.

* Kolom 1: Material Number
  PV_HEADER = 'Material Number'.

* Kolom 2-13: filler kosong (12 kolom)
  DO 12 TIMES.
    CONCATENATE PV_HEADER LV_TAB '' INTO PV_HEADER.
  ENDDO.

* Kolom 14: Plant
  CONCATENATE PV_HEADER LV_TAB 'Plant' INTO PV_HEADER.

* Kolom 15-95: filler kosong (81 kolom)
  DO 81 TIMES.
    CONCATENATE PV_HEADER LV_TAB '' INTO PV_HEADER.
  ENDDO.

* Kolom 96: Inspection Type
  CONCATENATE PV_HEADER LV_TAB 'Inspection Type' INTO PV_HEADER.
ENDFORM.                    " BUILD_HEADER_QUALITY
